    "%@. Detailed artwork can still be exported one size down, or as a still frame, to stay under Apple's 500 KB limit — the export always goes through." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-CN" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。细节丰富的图稿仍可缩小一个尺寸导出，或导出为静态帧，以符合 Apple 500 KB 的限制——文件始终可以导出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@。細節豐富的圖稿仍可縮小一個尺寸導出，或導出為靜態幀，以符合 Apple 500 KB 的限制——檔案始終可以導出。"
