    "Editing a sticker on device returns it to draft, and a draft cannot appear in a pack. Publish it again to bring it back — but saving the sticker list here drops it from the pack for good." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-CN" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在设备上编辑贴纸会将其变回草稿，草稿无法出现在贴纸包中。请再次发布以恢复它——但在此保存贴纸列表会永久将它从贴纸包中移除。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
